        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>This is the online version of STAT&#x2019;s weekly email newsletter Health Care Inc.&#xa0;<a href=\"https://www.statnews.com/category/health-care-inc/\">Sign up here</a>.</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Hello! Glad you&#x2019;re here. FYI: <a href=\"https://x.com/himbopottomus/status/2119221210798268533\" rel=\"noopener\">Amazing tweets still exist</a>. Don&#x2019;t be shy, tell me what&#x2019;s on your mind: <a href=\"mailto:bob.herman@statnews.com\" rel=\"noopener\">bob.herman@statnews.com</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-the-air-ambulance-company-that-s-suing-your-job\">The air ambulance company that&#x2019;s suing your job</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"h-the-air-ambulance-company-that-s-suing-your-jobjoe-hancock-the-owner-of-a-family-plumbing-and-heating-business-in-frankfort-ky-immediately-thought-it-was-a-bad-sign-when-he-got-a-big-box-in-the-mail-this-past-august-i-don-t-get-certified-mail-very-often-he-said\">Joe Hancock, the owner of a family plumbing and heating business in Frankfort, Ky., immediately thought it was a bad sign when he got a big box in the mail this past August. &#x201c;I don&#x2019;t get certified mail very often,&#x201d; he said.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/16/providers-sue-employers-to-collect-payment-health-insurance-costs-climb/?utm_campaign=rss\">Continue to STAT+ to read the full story&hellip;</a></p>"
